From 5b3187c4bf5c3e6459e4aa61ed916cdfe97bd8e7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Omkar Chandorkar <gotenksIN@aospa.co>
Date: Sat, 29 Aug 2026 18:20:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Settings: Start-align UDFPS enroll skip button on low sensors

The GlifExpressive footer stretches a lone secondary button
edge-to-edge, which overlaps a low-positioned UDFPS sensor in
portrait. Keep the real themed footer button and start-align it
instead of replacing it.

[jyotiraditya]: Reworked this to operate directly on the existing
FooterBarMixin button via LayoutParams/gravity instead of adding a
custom skip view, dimens, and style, and cleaned up naming.

Co-authored-by: Jyotiraditya Panda <jyotiraditya@aospa.co>
Change-Id: Ib7705fbb2d1190a55a94753bc2781929891193ee
Signed-off-by: Jyotiraditya Panda <jyotiraditya@aospa.co>
Signed-off-by: Saalim Quadri <danascape@gmail.com>
---

